# Project Overview

The **Synergy** program has two interconnected Power Apps sharing one Dataverse environment.

## Applications

1. **Project Management** (model-driven) — Partners, Projects, Contracts, Resources.
   Used by PMs, BDUs, Resource Managers. Feeds data INTO the Invoice app.
2. **Invoice Canvas** (Canvas) — create, manage, and track invoices.
   Reads partner/project/contract data from the PM app. Stores invoices in
   `dia_invoicedetails` / EntitySetName `dia_invoicedetailses`.
   **This is the primary app under automation.**

## Invoice app technical entry

- Renders ENTIRELY inside `iframe[name="fullscreen-app-host"]` (see `10-canvas-app-conventions`).
- URLs come from `config/env.ts` via `ENV=dev|sit|qa|uat` (never prod).
- DEV defaults are in that file; SIT/QA/UAT are filled when available (or via `APP_URL` /
  `DATAVERSE_URL` overrides).
- Auth: Azure AD (+ MFA). Backend: Dataverse (`https://{org}.crm8.dynamics.com`).

## Environments (never production)

| Env | Purpose | Auth path |
|-----|---------|-----------|
| DEV | Primary authoring / debug (default) | `auth/dev/*.json` |
| SIT | System integration | `auth/sit/*.json` |
| QA  | Quality assurance | `auth/qa/*.json` |
| UAT | User acceptance | `auth/uat/*.json` |

Each env has its own app URL, Dataverse URL, and auth session (`auth/` is gitignored).
Seed partners/projects/contracts are created per env and discovered via Dataverse OData —
never hardcode DEV entity names/GUIDs.

## Automation scope

- Invoice Canvas **UI** testing
- Dataverse API validation (UI counts vs backend)
- Role-based testing (PM vs BDU/Admin) — see `30-roles-and-security`
- Screen/flow behavior — see `50-app-functionality`
- Multi-env execution via `ENV` — see `config/env.ts` and `phase2.md`
